<section class="container mx-auto mt-15">
  <div
    class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-4 sm:gap-4 lg:grid-cols-8 lg:gap-8"
  >
    <div class="col-span-4 sm:col-span-5 lg:col-span-3 lg:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Retail Media. Simplified. Finally</h2>
      <p class="mt-18 text-xl">
        Stop juggling 6 different dashboards. Stop paying a percentage of your
